  "description": "In-process Google Cloud SQL connector for .NET. Establishes a secure mTLS connection to a Cloud SQL instance (Postgres, MySQL, SQL Server) directly from your application — no separate Cloud SQL Auth Proxy process or sidecar required. Handles instance metadata discovery, automatic ephemeral client-certificate rotation, IAM database authentication, and an in-process loopback endpoint any ADO.NET driver can connect to. AddCloudSqlConnector().",
